-sname example

-setcookie example_cookie

+A30

## Protocols consolidated by `rebar3 mix consolidate_protocols` are copied
## here by the overlay in rebar.config. -pa puts them ahead of the
## unconsolidated protocol modules shipped in the Elixir apps.
## ROOTDIR and RELEASE_VSN are exported by the relx start script.
-pa ${ROOTDIR}/releases/${RELEASE_VSN}/consolidated
